OL,3,APrince Harry praises war veterans on
OL,4,Asurprise visit to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has received an
OL,7,Fenthusiastic welcome in a surprise
OL,8,Fvisit to Ukraine to support injured war
OL,9,Fveterans, meeting Ukrainian competitors
OL,10,Ftaking part in his Invictus Games.
OL,12,FThere were emotional scenes as he was
OL,13,Fapplauded by injured service men and
OL,14,Fwomen in Lviv, where he told his
OL,15,Faudience: "You're going to win the
OL,16,Fwar."
OL,18,FPrince Harry spent two days at events
OL,19,Ffor veterans, with a press blackout for
OL,20,Fsecurity reasons until he had left
OL,21,FUkraine, as the country continues to
OL,22,Fface missile attacks from Russia.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
