OL,3,A'Steering casualty' preceded New
OL,4,AOrleans cruise ship collision, says
OL,5,ANTSB
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe tanker that struck a cruise ship
OL,8,Fdocked in New Orleans on Friday had a
OL,9,F"steering casualty", officials said,
OL,10,Fciting preliminary findings into the
OL,11,Fcollision.
OL,13,FIt remains unclear what caused the
OL,14,Fsteering failure on the Atlantic
OL,15,FAsphalt cargo vessel, the National
OL,16,FTransportation Safety Board (NTSB) said
OL,17,Fin a media briefing on Sunday.
OL,19,FThe collision left 32 people from the
OL,20,Fstricken American Heritage riverboat in
OL,21,Fhospital with non-critical injuries,
OL,22,Fbut no-one was unaccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
